{"vacant":[{"c":"There were several rooms still vacant.","cn":"还有几间空房。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #32625 (CM) & #5900388 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/32625"}],"vacation":[{"c":"How did you spend your winter vacation?","cn":"你的寒假怎么过的？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #279653 (CK) & #8686670 (crescat)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/279653"},{"c":"I didn't do anything during my vacation.","cn":"在假期中我什麼都沒有做。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #5165053 (shibeilei) & #5114740 (xjjAstrus)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/5165053"}],"vacuum":[{"c":"I got this vacuum cleaner for nothing.","cn":"我免費得到了這個吸塵器。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #253706 (CK) & #802144 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/253706"},{"c":"Cats hate vacuum cleaners.","cn":"猫很讨厌吸尘器。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #870412 (Scott) & #574937 (humihiro)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/870412"}],"vague":[{"c":"She had a vague feeling of guilt.","cn":"她隱約地有一種的內疚感。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #308728 (CK) & #796055 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/308728"},{"c":"She gave us a vague answer.","cn":"她給了我們一個模糊的答案。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #314067 (CK) & #805027 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/314067"}],"vain":[{"c":"All our efforts were in vain.","cn":"我们所有的努力都白费了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #23353 (CK) & #349673 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/23353"},{"c":"All their efforts were in vain.","cn":"他們的努力都白費了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #305272 (CK) & #794053 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/305272"}],"valid":[{"c":"This ticket is valid for three days.","cn":"這張票的有效期是三天。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #530682 (papabear) & #905793 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/530682"},{"c":"It's valid until March thirty-first, nineteen-ninety-seven.","cn":"有效期到1997年3月31日为止。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #324454 (CM) & #332767 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/324454"}],"valley":[{"c":"They marched northwest into the Shenandoah Valley.","cn":"他們向西北方向進軍，進入了謝南多厄河谷。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #802663 (Source_VOA) & #13573400 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/802663"},{"c":"We went down to the valley where the village is.","cn":"我們下到山谷裡，那裡有個村莊。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #248132 (CK) & #13573411 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/248132"}],"valuable":[{"c":"Real friendship is more valuable than money.","cn":"真正的友谊比金钱更有价值。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #322233 (CK) & #482695 (biglion)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/322233"},{"c":"Nothing is more valuable than friendship.","cn":"沒有比友情更有價值的東西。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #660412 (CK) & #6091678 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/660412"}],"value":[{"c":"The value of the yen has soared.","cn":"日元的價值大幅上升。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #25965 (CK) & #873391 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/25965"},{"c":"We cannot overestimate the value of health.","cn":"我们不能高估健康的价值。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #238978 (CM) & #791404 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/238978"}],"van":[{"c":"He imitated the works of Van Gogh.","cn":"他模仿了梵高的作品。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #289854 (CK) & #430959 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/289854"},{"c":"That red car hit the blue van.","cn":"那輛紅色汽車撞到了藍色麵包車。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1242098 (CM) & #9179894 (xjjAstrus)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1242098"}],"variety":[{"c":"This store has a variety of spices.","cn":"這家商店有各種香料。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #57745 (CK) & #895629 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/57745"},{"c":"We talked about a variety of topics.","cn":"我們談了各種話題。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #326579 (CK) & #895566 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/326579"}],"various":[{"c":"He tried to unify the various groups.","cn":"他試著統一不同的團體。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #304511 (CK) & #881739 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/304511"},{"c":"Japan imports various raw materials from abroad.","cn":"日本從國外進口各種原料。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #281511 (CK) & #797051 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/281511"}],"vary":[{"c":"Social customs vary from country to country.","cn":"国家不同，习俗各异。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #265341 (CK) & #334128 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/265341"},{"c":"Opinions vary from person to person.","cn":"观点因人而异。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #269908 (CM) & #1695461 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/269908"}],"vase":[{"c":"I filled up the vase with water.","cn":"我倒水進去花瓶裡。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2109209 (Roedgroed) & #1227147 (tsayng)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2109209"},{"c":"Put some water into the vase.","cn":"在花瓶裡裝些水。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #23742 (CK) & #858791 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/23742"}],"vast":[{"c":"The Sahara is a vast desert.","cn":"撒哈拉沙漠广袤无垠。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #54060 (CM) & #1454464 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/54060"}],"vat":[{"c":"Tom fell into a vat of sulfuric acid.","cn":"Tom 摔倒进一桶硫酸中","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #5973391 (Hybrid) & #5973392 (zhangxr91)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/5973391"}],"vegetable":[{"c":"She cooked vegetable soup for us.","cn":"她為我們煮了蔬菜湯。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #314085 (CK) & #850375 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/314085"},{"c":"The tomato is a vegetable, not a fruit.","cn":"番茄是蔬菜而不是水果。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #37442 (CM) & #1788075 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/37442"}],"vegetarian":[{"c":"Tom's new girlfriend is a vegetarian.","cn":"汤姆新的女朋友是素食主义者。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1488790 (Spamster) & #10696013 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1488790"},{"c":"Tom might be a vegetarian.","cn":"湯姆可能是素食者。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3734739 (CK) & #6151294 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3734739"}],"venus":[{"c":"Venus doesn’t have any moons.","cn":"金星沒有衛星。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #5322671 (Hybrid) & #4262122 (egg0073)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/5322671"}],"veranda":[{"c":"They have a very nice veranda.","cn":"他们有一个非常漂亮的暖房。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #895090 (pauldhunt) & #847837 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/895090"}],"verb":[{"c":"A sentence normally has a subject and a verb.","cn":"句子通常有主詞和動詞。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #320022 (CK) & #11969208 (corina)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/320022"}],"verge":[{"c":"She was on the verge of crying.","cn":"她要哭出来了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #313675 (CK) & #796633 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/313675"},{"c":"The poor child was on the verge of starvation.","cn":"那可憐的孩子快餓死了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #63451 (Dejo) & #1223762 (tsayng)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/63451"}],"verify":[{"c":"I can verify that that's the truth myself.","cn":"我自己能够证实那是真的。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #5896421 (peterius) & #1790109 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/5896421"}],"verse":[{"c":"He translated the verse into English.","cn":"他把诗翻译成英语。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1315801 (CK) & #10021369 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1315801"}],"version":[{"c":"This dictionary isn't the most recent version.","cn":"這本字典不是最新版的。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #682314 (Source_VOA) & #6332408 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/682314"},{"c":"I've heard the French version of this song.","cn":"我听过这首歌的法语版。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1318696 (CK) & #334620 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1318696"}],"very":[{"c":"All of us like you very much.","cn":"我们都非常喜欢你。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #248305 (CM) & #510780 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/248305"},{"c":"All three of you are very lucky.","cn":"你們三個很走運。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3749297 (CK) & #6159156 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3749297"}],"very much":[{"c":"All of us like you very much.","cn":"我们都非常喜欢你。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #248305 (CM) & #510780 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/248305"},{"c":"I don't think she cares very much.","cn":"我不认为她很在意。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #310301 (CK) & #2007047 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/310301"}],"vest":[{"c":"Tom was wearing a bulletproof vest, so the bullet didn't kill him.","cn":"湯姆穿著一件防彈衣，所以子彈沒把他殺死。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1103210 (CK) & #8356142 (xjjAstrus)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1103210"}],"veteran":[{"c":"Tom is a Vietnam veteran.","cn":"汤姆是一个越军退役军人。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #5085379 (Hybrid) & #5085423 (Jubilee11)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/5085379"}],"veterinarian":[{"c":"She grew up to be a veterinarian.","cn":"她長大後成為了一名獸醫。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #315310 (CK) & #802070 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/315310"},{"c":"Tom wanted to become a veterinarian.","cn":"那时汤姆相当一个兽医。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3403379 (CK) & #6822762 (basilhan)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3403379"}],"veterinary":[{"c":"Tom has a veterinary background.","cn":"Tom有獸醫背景。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #4493586 (CK) & #4504477 (egg0073)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4493586"}],"vibrate":[{"c":"Tom felt his phone vibrate.","cn":"汤姆感觉手机震荡了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3403378 (CK) & #6822759 (basilhan)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3403378"}],"vice":[{"c":"They nominated Calvin Coolidge for vice president.","cn":"他们提名卡尔文•柯立芝为副总统。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #802664 (Source_VOA) & #5640773 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/802664"}],"victim":[{"c":"The victim died at a hospital in Boston.","cn":"受害者在醫院裡死去了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #5360753 (CK) & #6150883 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/5360753"}],"victory":[{"c":"They congratulated us on our victory.","cn":"他們祝賀我們的勝利。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #306733 (CK) & #779069 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/306733"},{"c":"It's an easy victory.","cn":"這是一個輕鬆取得的勝利。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #435761 (CK) & #819342 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/435761"}],"video":[{"c":"I haven't watched that video yet.","cn":"我还没看过那段视频。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #8340565 (CK) & #8514549 (gumblex)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/8340565"},{"c":"I haven't yet watched that video.","cn":"我还没看过那段视频。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #8340564 (CK) & #8514549 (gumblex)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/8340564"}],"view":[{"c":"It is a nice view from here.","cn":"从这儿看景色很美。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #62117 (CK) & #1446976 (asosan)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/62117"},{"c":"How do you view this matter?","cn":"您怎麼看這個問題？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #59461 (CM) & #918671 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/59461"}],"village":[{"c":"He grew up in a little village.","cn":"他在一個小村莊裡長大。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #299545 (CK) & #875372 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/299545"},{"c":"He lives in a village near Osaka.","cn":"他住在大阪附近一座鎮上。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #2002408 (jackchak) & #884656 (Tajfun)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2002408"}],"violin":[{"c":"He is very good at playing violin.","cn":"他非常擅長拉小提琴。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #289321 (CK) & #887778 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/289321"},{"c":"Did you hear my son play the violin?","cn":"您听见我儿子拉小提琴了吗？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #69310 (CK) & #336078 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/69310"}],"viral":[{"c":"The video quickly went viral.","cn":"这个视频很快火了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #6580095 (Hybrid) & #10635235 (gumblex)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/6580095"}],"virulent":[{"c":"Ebola is one of the most virulent viruses known to man.","cn":"埃博拉是人类已知的最致命的病毒之一。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #8558454 (marioo) & #8563313 (slo_oth)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/8558454"}],"virus":[{"c":"The computer has a virus.","cn":"那台電腦中毒了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10110894 (ddnktr) & #12042141 (corina)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/10110894"}],"visa":[{"c":"How long is this visa good for?","cn":"這個簽證的有效期限是多久?","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #60615 (CK) & #881519 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/60615"},{"c":"I applied for a visa.","cn":"我申请了签证。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #34786 (CK) & #512510 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/34786"}],"visibility":[{"c":"The snow was reducing visibility.","cn":"大雪降低了能見度。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #10687237 (sundown) & #13530094 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/10687237"}],"visible":[{"c":"Tom rolled up his trouser legs, making his bright red socks visible.","cn":"湯姆捲起褲管，露出鮮紅的襪子。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #9939744 (sundown) & #13539426 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/9939744"}],"vision":[{"c":"My vision is getting worse these days.","cn":"这些天我的视力正在变差。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #243855 (CK) & #333217 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/243855"},{"c":"I had a vision.","cn":"我有一个设想。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1887332 (CK) & #5091184 (mirrorvan)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1887332"}],"visit":[{"c":"Did you visit the Tower of London?","cn":"你參觀倫敦塔了嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #29249 (CK) & #874489 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/29249"},{"c":"I look forward to your next visit.","cn":"我期待著您的再次光臨。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #32656 (CK) & #889148 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/32656"}],"visitor":[{"c":"She's a frequent visitor to this country.","cn":"她经常来这个国家。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #312396 (CK) & #8893583 (crescat)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/312396"},{"c":"She showed the visitor her baby.","cn":"她给客人看了她的宝宝。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #313165 (CK) & #332891 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/313165"}],"vitamin":[{"c":"Carrots contain a lot of vitamin A.","cn":"胡蘿蔔中含有大量的維生素A。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #270365 (CK) & #797070 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/270365"},{"c":"Oranges contain a lot of vitamin C.","cn":"柳丁含有大量的維生素 C。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #64781 (CK) & #891131 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/64781"}],"vocabulary":[{"c":"You need a large vocabulary to read that book.","cn":"你讀那本書需要大量詞彙。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #43868 (CK) & #6131458 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/43868"}],"voice":[{"c":"A parrot can mimic a person's voice.","cn":"鸚鵡會模仿人的聲音。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #65170 (Dejo) & #796974 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/65170"},{"c":"His voice is pleasant to listen to.","cn":"他的声音很悦耳。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1223870 (sacredceltic) & #1454448 (sadhen)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1223870"}],"volcanic":[{"c":"Volcanic ash disrupted air travel.","cn":"火山灰阻礙航運。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1103245 (supplementfacts) & #1250637 (tsayng)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1103245"}],"volcano":[{"c":"The volcano erupted suddenly, killing many people.","cn":"火山突然喷发，造成了多人死亡。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #49234 (CK) & #8938668 (crescat)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/49234"},{"c":"The volcano has become active again.","cn":"這座火山又開始活動了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #23846 (CK) & #893359 (Martha)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/23846"}],"volleyball":[{"c":"Some people like volleyball, others enjoy tennis.","cn":"有些人喜欢排球，其他人喜欢网球。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #336060 (killer4o) & #336107 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/336060"},{"c":"Volleyball is a lot of fun.","cn":"排球很有意思。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #3331148 (CK) & #5942069 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3331148"}],"volume":[{"c":"Where's the volume control?","cn":"音量調節在哪裡？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #8511001 (CK) & #13108740 (LeviHighway)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/8511001"},{"c":"Turn the volume up so that the students at the back can hear.","cn":"声音大声一点，以便让坐在后边的学生能听到。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1577407 (CM) & #1577382 (GlossaMatik)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1577407"}],"vote":[{"c":"Who will you vote for for president?","cn":"你選誰當總統？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1042587 (GPHemsley) & #6064656 (verdastelo9604)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1042587"},{"c":"Did you vote yet?","cn":"您已經投了票了嗎？","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #1273883 (CM) & #6015799 (xjjAstrus)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1273883"}],"voyage":[{"c":"Mary went on a voyage around the world.","cn":"玛丽去环游世界了。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #31913 (mamat) & #472805 (fucongcong)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/31913"}],"vulgar":[{"c":"She is extremely vulgar in her speech.","cn":"她讲话非常俗气。","attribution":"CC-BY 2.0 (France) Attribution: tatoeba.org #317520 (CM) & #2031459 (ydcok)","sourceUrl":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/317520"}]}
